<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amos</book>
  <para style="h">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amos</para>
  <para style="mt">Amos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia Tekoa khua pan tuu cingpa khat ahi Amos ii kammalte ahi hi. Judah kumpi in Uzziah maang a, Israel kumpi in Jehoash tapa Jeroboam a khan hun, zinliin ma kum nii lai in, Pathian in Amos tungah Israel huvau hi thute theampo lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amos in, “ Topa sia Zion mual pan hawk a; Jerusalem pan a aw sia hong nging keak hi. Ngan thana munte ko a, Carmel mual a lopate vul hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in, “Damascus mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang amate daan pia tatak tu khi hi. Amate in Gilead mite tungah ngilo in vawtsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Kumpipa Hazael saksa kumpi inn sia meikuang khiakin Kumpi Benhadad ii kulhte haltham tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damascus khuapi kongpite sutham in, Aven Kuam a teang mihingte le Betheden a ukpa heam tu khi hi. Syria mite sia Kir ngam ah luangta tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in “Gaza mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang amate daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in minam bup paipui in Edom mite tungah salin zuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang Gaza khuapi luphung tungah meikuang ka khiak tu a, a kulhte ka haltum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ashdod le Ashkelon khuapite a ukte ka heam tu hi. Ekron khuapi daan ka pia tu a, Philistine mite a taanglai theampo thi tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in, “Tyre mite maw kikik, khial kikik ahiciang amate daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in minam bup Edom ah sal tang tu in paisak a, kipawlmat natu thukimna a vawt sia len ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom Tyre khuapi luphung tungah meikuang ka khiak tu a, a kulhpite ka haltham tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Edom mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in a suapui Israel te savai bangin vai a, hesuak ngawl hi. Amate thin uukna sia ciangtan nei ngawl a, thaisak ngeingawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom Teman khuapi tungah meikuang ka khiak tu a, Bozrah kulhpite ka haltum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Ammon mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang amate daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in ngamkeau ngal kisimna sung Gilead khua ah naupaai numeite ngawngawn ii ngil kuikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom Rabbah khuapi luphungte tungah meikuang ka khiak tu a, a kulhpite ka haltum tu hi. Tuasia ciang ngal kisim ni in auna awsa om ngawp tu a, kidona nasia in vuipi suangval bang phet ma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate kumpipa le a uliante saltaang in pai tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in, “Moab mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang amate daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in Edom kumpipa ii ngute sia zawnsak vawtin haltham a, vut suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab ngam ah meikuang ka khiak tu a, Kerioth kulhpite ka haltham tu hi. Ngal kisimna ah ngalkapte au in lemle tum a, tua awsa lialua sungah Moab mite thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Moab ngamukpa le ngam lampuite theampo ka thatlum tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in, “Judah mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang amate daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in ka hilnate thusim ngawl a ka thupiakte zui ngawl uh hi. A taanghpupi ii biak a maan ngawl pathiante ma in amate lam pialsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom Judah tungah meikuang ka khiak tu a, Jerusalem kulhpite ka haltum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite maw kikik khial kikik ahiciang amate daan ka pia tatak tu hi. Amate in leiba a lo zo ngawl mi thumaante, peangdap kop khat ii man zongh a pia kik zo ngawl mizawng teng sal in zuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a thazawm a cimawte tuanhpeak in mizawngte sawn vawk hi. Pasal khat le a ta in a sila nu luppui khawm a, tua bangin ka min thiangtho daisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biak kikhopna mun theampo ah, a zawngte ii leitoai natu a pon puante sia mite in luppha in nei uh hi. Amate in sum a bate tung pan a laak sapittui zongh, a Pathian biakinn sungah ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tua ahitazong ka mite awng cedar thingkungte bangin saang a, oak thingkungte bangin a thakho, Amor te ka sukcipna sia noma kong khualna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Egypt ngam pan kong pusuaksak a, sennealngam kaantanin kum sawmli sung lam kong pui a, noma atu in Amor te ngam kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tapate pawlkhat kamsaang tu in ka teal a, na khangmoi tangval pawlkhat Nazirite tu in ka teal hi. Hi thute thumaan hi kana ngawl ziam, Israel mite awng? Keima Topa in ka ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang tua Nazirite te sapittui na nesak uh a, ka thusonte a son kik ngawl natu in kamsaangte thu na pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in note lei ah kong henpeak tu a, antang a dimin a kiheang leang khat bangin na mau tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tai manlangte zongh suakta ngawl tu uh hi; mihing thakhote a tha bo tu a, tuaciang ngalkapte zongh in a nuntakna uh kihuu zo ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thal toaite in nalh zo ngawl tu a, tai manlangte suakta ngawl tu hi, siphu tung to mite in a nuntakna suatak ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni in a hangbel ngalkapte zongh a ngalhiamte khia in tai tu uh hi,” ci hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt ngam pan minam bup in ama ii hong pusuasak Israel mite awng, note huvau Topa pauna hi thu ngai vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leitung minam theampo sung pan kong heak le kong thin nop mawk sia noma bek na hi uh hi. Hi thu in noma mawna khialna nasiasak seseam a, tua hu in daan kong piak kul tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kisiktua natu in vaihawmna omkhol ngawlin mihing nii khualhaw khawm thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawpi in sa mat tu khat mu ngawl bulin duisung ah hawk thawthong na ziam? Tawpi moi khat in mat khat nei buale a kua sungah thuum vangam na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thaang a kisia ciang aitaana khat om buale vacim awk ngei na ziam? Thaang keaksa sia a pealsak khat a om buale peal na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuapi sungah khua mite a lausak ngawl tu ngal patau lemle a kitum om na ziam? Topa in a puak buale khuapi khat ah tuasiatna theng tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in a naseam kamsaangte tungah a tupna kilanghsak phot ngawlin bangma seam ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tawpi a hawk ciang akua lau ngawlin om thei tu ziam? Vaanglianpipa Topa a pau ciang a thu thangsak ngawlin akua om thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ashdod le Egypt kumpi innte sung a teangte munah hi bangin taangko vun: “Samaria kiimkot mualte tungah kikhawm vun a, tua munah a nasia mama buaina le khialna liante en vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in, “Hi mite in a innpite sia khialna lian le ngongtatna taw a laaksak vanhte taw dimh uh hi. Amate in thumaan natu zia ngawngawn he ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngal in a ngam kiim uum in, a kidalnate susia tu a, a innte phuulsak tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in, “Tuucing khat in tawpi khat ii a neakmong tuu ii peang nii ahibuale tuu ii bil khat bekma a top kik vathiam bangma, tu in lupna nuam niknek tungah a nop om Samaria te tawm bek luhai tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in ngai vun, Jacob suan le paalte tungah kidopna tu zasak vun,” Vaanglianpipa Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel te a mawnate hu in daan ka piak ni ciang, Bethel a biaknataute ka susia tu hi. Biaknatau sim ii a taw king teng kisutan tu a, lei ah puk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phalbi innte le khuakhaal innte ka susia tu hi. Saiha taw a kizeam innte siacip in, cimh tu hi; inn lian theampo kisusia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A thaneamte vawtsia a, mizawngte a nengniam, na pasalte ii zuhang hong piak tan tu a ngen, pha takin a kivaak, Bashan a khuipuite bangin a thau, no, Samaria numeite awng, hi thu ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa thiangtho ahi bangma ama in, “Amate in note thikkoai taw hong kai tu hun hong theng tu hi; note khat simin ngasa tangthaakna thikkoai khat tung a awk ngasa khat bang hi tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Luphung hawngvang nai belna ah note hong kikai keak tu a, a pua ah hong kilawnthal tu hi,” ci in hong kamciam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Israel mite awng, na hi nuam vangaat uh le mun thiangtho Bethel ah pai in mawna khialna vawt tavun! Gilgal ah pai vun a, na tha neiza uh taw maw tavun! Paisuak vun a, zing khat zawk ciangin zing khat sangaw biakpiak tu ngannote hong paipui tavun, ni thum simin na sawm a khat hong paipui tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Paisuak vun a, Pathian tungah lungdamkona in na anluumte pia vun a, na piak thua uh biakpiaknate tungtaang ah kisuangtaak vun! Hisia in na sep thanop uhte nam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in, “Na khuapite theampo tungah kialpi a tungsak sia keima khi hi, ahihang kei kung nong zuan kik bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lo ante ii kisapbel hun laitakin nguatui ka hangsak hi. Khuapi khat sungah ngua ka zusak a, khat sungah ngua ka hangsak hi. Lo khat sungah nguazu a, a dang lo khat kocip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dangkona taw tha zawmin, khuapi tam ma ii mite sia khuapi khat ah tui mu tu ki um in a pai uh hang neakkhom tu a om bua hi. Tua hi napi, kei kung nong zuan kik tuan bua lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na lo ante nguataksak tu in vuisa ka vasak hi. Khaumawte in na huan an le sapitkung te, na theikung le olive kung te netum uh hi. Kei kung nong zuan kik bua lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Pul natna khat Egypt ah ka tunsak bangin no tungah kong tungsak hi. Na khangnote ngal sungah ka thatlum a, na siphu te ka la hi. Na ngiaphual uh ah mithi uih taw na naakvang kong dim hi. Tuabang hi napi kei kungah nong heak kik tuan bua lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“No pawlkhat sia Sodom le Gomorrah ka suksiat bangin kong susia hi. No a thi mong teng sia meikhuk khat pan a kiteen thingkhua kaanghmong bang na hi uh hi. Tua hi napi, kei kung nong zuan kik tuan bua lai uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuabang ahikom, Israel mite awng, note daan hong pia tu khi hi. Hi sia vawt tu ka hi ciang ka thukhenna thuak tu in kinging sa in om vun!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in mualte a vawt pa le vuite a bitphuapa ahi hi. Ama in a ngaisutnate mihing in hesak hi; ama in sun sia zan suaksak hi. Ama in leitung saangnate tungah vak hi. Hisia ama min hi: Vaanglianbelpa Topa Pathian ahi hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel mite awng, note atu in hi mithi vuina la kong sak sia ngai vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Numei thiangtho Israel puk zo hi! Tho kik ngei nawn ngawl tu hi! Ama lei ah kinusia in lum hi, kuama in ama phongto ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa in, “Israel khuapi khat in ngalkap tulkhat paisak ahihang, zakhat bek heak kik hi; khuapi dang khat in zakhat paisak ahihang, sawm bek heak kik hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in Israel mite tungah, “Kei kungah hong pai tavun, tua hile na nungta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Biakkikhopna vawt tu in Beersheba ah pai heak vun. Bethel ah kei hong zong heak vun — Bethel sia a luithawthong suak tu hi. Gilgal ah pai heak vun — a mite saltaang in lal tu uh hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa kungah pai vun, tua hile na nungta tu uh hi. Na pai bua uh le Israel mite tungah meikuang bangin Topa hong tuaksuk tu hi. Bethel mite mei in kaanghtum tu hi, kuama in tua mei sumit zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thukhaikimte siatsua a, tuaciang mite ii nga tute a theam note a lalsa na hi uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in siluk le zawlzawng aksite vawt hi. Ama in khuazing sia khuavak suaksak a, sun sia zan suaksak hi. Ama in tuipi tuite samin lei ah bunghkeak hi. Ama min in Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a thahatte le a kulh muanhuaite suksiatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Note in thukhenzum ah thutang khen ngawlna a nalhte le thumaan thutak vive a sonte na ensan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zawngte na nengniam uh a, a antangte na suttol uh hi. Tua hu in noma saksa suanginn phate sungah na teang buatu uh a, noma ciin sapithuan hoite pan sapittui na ne buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mawna uh bangza in kiitakhuai a, khialna lian bangza vawt zo nu ziam ci sia ka he hi. Mihing phate vawtsia in, sumnguk ne a, thukhenzum ah mizawngte atu in thukhaikim a kisep natu na khaam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahiciang hi bang hunsia laitakin thim khipkhep a om na in a pilvang ngamtatna ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na nuntak thei natu in siatna vawt ngawlin a maan vawt sawm vun. Tua hile kote kungah Vaanglianbel Topa Pathian om hi na ci uh bangin note taw om takpi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thusia ngaimaw in thu man dei vun a, thukhenzumte ah thukhaikim omsak vun. Hi ngamte sungah a nungta lai mite Topa in hesuak thei tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom Vaanglianpipa Topa Vaanglianbelpa in, “Khuapi lampite ah heena, kaana le tauna om tu hi. Lotho mite ngawngawn zongh a khuangaipui tu in a kicialte taw ma in mithi kaa tu kisam khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sapit huan theampo sungah kaana om tu hi. Hite theampo hong theng tu hi, banghang ziam cile keima in note daan pia tu in kong pai hi,” ci hi. Topa in ci zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa ni ngaingam in a ngakla note atu in bangza in lauhuai tu ziam! Tua ni in note bang phattuamna hong pia tu ziam? Note atu in tua sia khuavak ni hi ngawlin khuazin ni hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua sia tawpi kung pan tai a, vompui taw a kisi pasal sia bang hi tu nu hi! Tua ahibuale pasal khat inn hong cia a, pang tung zawt napo kinei sia, ngul ii tuk taw kibang tu nu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa ni in khuazing hong paipui tu a khuavak hong paipui ngawl tu hi; tua ni sia maitaina om ngawlin lungzin ni khat hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa in, “Na biakna poaite ngaimaw khi hi; tuate sia kiihuai sa khi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Meihal biakpiakna le antang biakpiakna nong piak uh ciang hong saang ngawl tu khi hi; kei biakpiakna in nong paipui, thau takin na vak nganhingte hong saang ngawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A nangonhuai na lasak uhte tawp vun; na tengtongh awte ngai nuam ngawl khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate taangin thukhaikim sia luitui bangin luangsak vun a, thutang sia a kang ngeingawl ngun bangin luang tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Israel mite awng, sennealngam kaantan in kum sawmli sung kong lampui lai in sangaw biakpiaknate le piakkhiatnate kong ngen bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahihang tu in na pathian kumpi Sakkuth ii lim le na aksi pathian Kaiwan limte na biak uh ahikom tua milimte zongh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Damascus kalhin saltaang tu in kong lak ciang, na puak uh kul tu hi,” Vaanglianbelpa Pathian a kici Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samaria ah ngammuang kisate le Zion ah nuntakna ol a sate — hi Israel ngamlian sung a, ngual ii hu hong kingetna, no lampui uliante atu in bangza in lauhuai ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Va pai in Calneh khuapi en tavun. Tua zawkciang khuapi lian Hamath ah paisuak tavun a, tuaciang, Philistine te khuapi Gath ah paisuk tavun. Tuate in Judah le Israel kumpi ngamte sangin phazaw ziam? Amate ngam sia no a sangin zaizaw ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasiatna ni hong thet tu thu sia na um nuam bua uh a, ahizong noma ii ngamtatna ma in tua ni naisak seseam bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nuam niknek na lupna tungah nop om a, khuino sa le tuuno sa taw a kivaak note atu bangza in lauhuai ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David bangin la phuak nuam in, tengtongh taw lasak sia dik na sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sapittui khawbeam dimin taalin, paaknamtui phabelte zangh nu hi, ahihang Israel zaancipna tungtaang ah na mau bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahiciang note salin a pai phit tute na hi uh hi. Na biakna poaite le anneak poaite bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa , Vaanglianbelpa in hi a ciliap huai kidopna tu thupia zo hi: “Israel mite ii kiphatsakna ka ngaimaw hi; amate ii inn nuam mamate ka kii hi. Amate khuapi le a sung a om theampo ngalte ka pia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Innkuan khat sungah pasal sawm a kikhe le amate thi tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mithi vui tu a kisee sa mithipa ii beepa in, inn sung pan a luang pusuapui tu hi. A beepa in inn sungah a taanglai khat pawpo sia tungah “Tua munah khat po nang taw a om dang a om lai ziam?” ci in sam tu hi. Aw khat in, “Om bo!” ci in zo tu hi. Tuaciang a beepa in, “Thim in! Topa ii min ngawngawn zongh ih law thaak ngawl natu in kidop kul tu hi,” ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in thu a piak tak ciang, innte a lian a no a bebekin kisaattham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suangte tungah siphute kinuntaw ziam? Mite in khuital taw tuipi tungah lotho ziam? Tua hikasap note in thutang sia nguu na suaksak uh a, a maan sia a khial na suaksak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lodebar khua a kilaak huvau in na kiphasak uh hi. “Karnaim a la zo tu in thahat khom ngawp hi zam,” ci in na kiphasak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Pathian Vaanglianbelpa mama in, “Israel mite awng, na ngam a la tu in ngamdang ngalkaphonpi khat hong paisak tu khi hi. Tuate in saksang Hamath Mual Ciangh pan thangsang Arabah Lui dong ah note hong zothaw tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa tung panin mukholna khat ka nga hi. Tua ii sungah kumpipa ii tel, ngan ante a ki at zawk bek, lopate a po kik sawngin khaumaw honpui khat Topa in a piansak ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mukholna sungah khaumawte in ngam sungah a hing theampo netum a, tuasia ciang keima in, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, na mite mawna maisak in! Bangbangin amate nungta zo tu ziam? Amate tawm mama a, thazawm uh hi!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in a thin kheal kik a, “Na mu bang piang ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa tung panin mukholna dang khat ka nei hi. Tua ii sungah ama in a mite meikuang taw daan pia tu in a kithoai ka mu hi. Mei in leinuai a tuipi lian sia kaanghtham a, tuaciang leitang mama kaanghtham tu kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang keima in, “Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, tawlnga in! Na mite bangbangin nungta thei tu ziam? Amate no mama a, thaneam hi!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a thin kheal kik a, “Hi sia zongh piang ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa tung panin mukholna dang khat ka nei hi. Tua ii sungah ama in teena khaukhai taw tee in, a kisa pang khat ii hui ah a ding ka mu hi. Ama khut sungah teena khaukhai khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, “Amos awng, bang na mu ziam?” ci in kei hong dongh hi. “Teena khaukhai khat” ci in ka zo hi. Tuaciang ama in “Ka mite khaukhai bangin a tang ngawl pang khat taw a kiban hunlam lakna in hi teena khaukhai ka zangh hi. Amate daan ka piak tu huvau ka thin ka kheal kik buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaac ii suan le paalte biakpiakna munte kisusia tu hi. Israel te ii a thiangtho munte zaancip in kinusia tu hi. Kumpipa Jeroboam ii kumpi khangngui ka bosak tu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Bethel thiampi Amaziah in Israel kumpipa Jeroboam tungah thu khat puak hi: “Amos in a mite sung panin nang hong thasawm hi. Ama ii kampaute in ngam susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi sia ama pauna hi: ‘Jeroboam sia ngal kisimna ah thi tu hi, tuaciang Israel mite sia amate ngamsung pan salin kipaipui tu hi.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Amaziah in Amos tungah, “Kamsaang pa awng, tu a teng pha zo hi! Judah ngam ah heak kik ta'n a, tualai ah thuhil ta'n. Amate in nang sum taw hong tham tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi lai Bethel ah kamsaanna nei nawn heak in. Hi mun sia kumpipa ii biakna mun hi a, ngammi bup ii biakinn hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amos in, “Kei sia sum thangaina taw kamsaang nam ka hi bua hi. Keima in ngancingpa khat ka hi a, theikungte ka keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in ka tuucin nasepna pan hong la in, a Israel mite kungah pai a, mukholna son tu in thu hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom tu in Topa paunate ngai in. Nangma in kamsaanna ka tawlngak natu le, Israel mite thuak tu in ka sonkeakna ka tawlngak natu nong son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom Amaziah awng, Topa in nang tungah, ‘Na zi sia lampi tungah pumpi zuak khat suak tu a, na tate ngal sungah kithatlum tu hi. Na leitang kihawmtham tu a, ngualdangte kipia tu hi, tuaciang nangma mama lawki ngam khat sungah na thi tu hi. Tuaciang Israel mite a ngam a lei pan leidang ah saltaang tu in kipaipui takpi tu hi,’ hong ci hi” ci in zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mukholna dang khat Vaanglianpipa Topa tung pan ka nei hi. Tua ii sungah thingnga a dim khum khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in, “Amos awng, bang mu ni ziam?” ci in hong dongh hi. “Thingnga a dim khum khat” ci in ka zo kik hi. Topa in kei tungah, “Israel ka mite atu in a tawpna hong theng zo hi. Amate daan ka piak tu huvau ka thin ka kheal kik buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ni ciang kumpi inn sungah a kisa late sia kaana le mauna aw suak tu hi. Mithi luangte mun theampo ah om tu hi. Tuate a thimtham in kivawk tu hi,” hong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngamsung a mizawngte susia in, a kitaangsamhte a tuanhpeak note awng, hi thu ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Noma le noma “ih antang ih zuak thei natu in ni thiangthote a bo tu ih ngak zo bua phial hi. Sumzuak ih kipat thei kik na tu in bang hun ciang Sabbath kiman tu ziam? Tuasia ciang, khaikhin maan ngawlte zanghin van leite a toai phaza theam a, na man ih khan thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zungtaang mannung ngawlte a man tamin ih zuak thei tu hi. A peangdap kop khat ii man zongh a pia zo ngawl, leiba a lo zo ngawl mizawng khat ih mu tu a, ama sal khatin ih lei tu hi,” na kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa , Israel te ii Pathian in, “Amate tatsiatnate ka mangil ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom zinliing tu a, ngam sungah a om theampo ngim nga tu hi. Ngam bup liinglawng tu a, Nile ngun bangin khang tuak, kiam tuakin om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sun kimlai in ni ka tumsak tu le suntangin leitung khua ka zinsak tu hun hong theng tu hi. Keima Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na poaipite mithi vuinate ka suaksak tu a, na lungdamna late sia heena, kaanate taw ka laih tu hi. Na lu uh a tolin meetsak in, khau-ip puan kong silhsak tu hi, tapa khat bek a nei sun thi a, a nu le a pa a kaa bangin kong kapsak tu hi. Tua ni sia a tawp dongin thuak hak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ngam sungah kialpi ka tunsak natu hun hong theng tu hi. Mihingte ngilkial tu ahihang andu ngilkial hi ngawl tu hi; a dangko tu ahihang tuidu dangtaak hi ngawl tu hi. Amate in Topa kung pan thupuak khat a deina in ngilkial dangtaak hi tu hi. Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa ka pau zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihingte sia Tuipi Thi pan Mediterranean ah, tuaciang saksang pan nisuana sangah vakvai tu uh hi. Amate in mun theampo ah Topa ii thupuak kammal khat kan tu ahihang mu ngawl tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni in ciidam khangmoi pasalte le numeite ngawngawn dangtaakin puk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria milimte ahi, ‘Dan pathian min taw’ ahibuale ‘Beersheba pathian min taw’ a kiciam peuma — tua mite puk tu a, tho kik nawn ngawl tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biaknatau hui ah Topa a din ka mu hi. Ama in thupia a: “Biakinn bangkua tung buppi a ngawk natu in a khuam dawnte nasia takin saat vun. Tuate taltansak vun a, mite lu tungah taaksak vun. A taanglai mite ngal sungah ka thatlum tu hi. Kuama puapial ngawl tu a; khat zongh suakta ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mithi khua dong lam a vawtsuk hial zong, amate ka man tu hi. Vantung keak ah a kaato zong ka kaisuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Carmel mualdawn ah a buu hial uh zong amate ka zong tu a, ka man tu hi. Kei kung pan tuipi taw ah a buu hial uh zong tuipi nganhingpui in ka petsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ngalte in manin luangtasak kale amate a thalup natu thu ka pia tu hi. Amate ka suksiat tu le ka hu ngawl tu sia khensat zo khi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa Vaanglianbelpa in leitung tham a, leitung liing hi; tua munah a teang theampo khuangai uh hi. Leitung buppi Nile ngun bangin khang tuak, kiam tuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in vantungte ah a inn sa a, leitung ii tungah van ii khuvum koi hi. Ama in tuipi tuite samin leitung ah buak hi. Ama min in Topa ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in, “Israel mite awng, note kong ngaisut bangza ma in Ethiopia mite ka ngaisun hi. Note Egypt pan kong paipui bangma in, Philistine te Crete pan, Syria te Kir pan ka paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima, Vaanglianpipa Topa in, hi a maw a khial Israel kumpi ngam ka encik nginge a, lei mai panin ka susia tu hi. Ahihang Jacob suan le paalte theampo ka susia buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Keima in thu ka pia tu a, ciang sungah an a kisak bangin Israel mite ka lok tu hi. A mannung ngawl theampo ka hep natu in minam tuatuamte sung pan amate ka lok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Pathian in eite kungah natna satna hong naisak bua in teh a ci theampo — ka mite sung a mawneite ngal sungah kithatlum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in, “Inn zaancip sa khat taw a kibang David kumpi ngam ka puuaphat kik tu ni khat hong theng tu hi. A luphung pangte pua kikin ka phasak kik tu hi. Tuasia ka sa kik tu a, nidang tawngh lai bang ka hisak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuabangin Israel mite in Edom ngam sungah a om lai sun teng le keima ngam ahi ngei theampo zothal tu hi,” ci a, Topa in hi thu a piangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in, “Lo ante kila man ngawl liangin a khan tu hun, sapitngate sapittui in kivawt man ngawl liangin a khan tu hun le a tun tu nite hong theng tu hi. Mualpite tung pan sapittui thum taak vakeu tu a, mualnote ah sapittui luang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mite a ngam a lei ah ka paipui kik tu hi. A khuapi zaancip sate, sa kikin, tua munah amate teang tu uh hi; Amate in sapithuan vawtin sapittui ne tu uh hi. Amate in huan vawt tu a, a ciinte ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mite ka piaksa ngam sungah ka teangsak tu hi, tuaciang amate kila keak kik ngawl tu hi,” ci hi. Topa na Pathian pau zo hi.
  </para>
</usx>
